ents{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"46044fcd9dfc72586fdd07a9264d80d4d11349bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllonKleinLab/paper-data/commits/46044fcd9dfc72586fdd07a9264d80d4d11349bc","html_url":"https://github.com/AllonKleinLab/paper-data/commit/46044fcd9dfc72586fdd07a9264d80d4d11349bc"}],"stats":{"total":2,"additions":1,"deletions":1},"files":[{"sha":"70c19d73f2dd866d06887688a2ed319b06fce73f","filename":"Scully_Ciona_blood_2025/README.md","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/AllonKleinLab/paper-data/blob/b8658b78c1c288019dfa60b6f50aace270528a29/Scully_Ciona_blood_2025%2FREADME.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/AllonKleinLab/paper-data/raw/b8658b78c1c288019dfa60b6f50aace270528a29/Scully_Ciona_blood_2025%2FREADME.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AllonKleinLab/paper-data/contents/Scully_Ciona_blood_2025%2FREADME.md?ref=b8658b78c1c288019dfa60b6f50aace270528a29","patch":"@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@\n-This folder contains auxillary code for the preprint: [insert citation]\n+This folder contains auxillary code for the paper: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cub.2025.10.032\n \n ## Data Availability\n scRNA-seq data of _C. robusta_ blood can be viewed interactively and downloaded from [https://kleintools.hms.harvard.edu/paper_websites/scully_ciona_robusta_blood/](https://kleintools.hms.harvard.edu/paper_websites/scully_ciona_robusta_blood/). Downloads are also available from the Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO) repository: Series [GSE296253](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/query/acc.cgi?acc=GSE296253) (full processed data and May 2023 libraries), and Sample GSM8869531 from Series [GSE292926](https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/query/acc.cgi?acc=GSE292926) (April 2022 library)."}]}